<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<%- include('../partials/subheader') %>

<main class="container">
  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <div style="font-size: 13px; margin: 10px 0 14px 2px; color: #666;">
    <a href="/" style="color: var(--primary-red); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;">🏠 Home</a>
    <span style="margin: 0 6px; color: #999;">»</span>
    <span style="color: #333; font-weight: 600;">About Us</span>
  </div>

  <div class="sarkari-box" style="margin-bottom: 30px; background: #ffffff;">
    <h1 class="sarkari-box-header" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.3; text-align: left; padding: 14px 20px;">
      About Govt Exam Zone - Real-Time Government Recruitment Portal
    </h1>

    <div class="static-page-content">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-red); font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px;">Who We Are</h2>
      <p>
        <b>Govt Exam Zone (govtexamzone.com)</b> is India's dedicated public educational portal created to provide timely, accurate, and direct access to Central and State Government examination notifications, online application forms, admit cards, answer keys, syllabus, and results.
      </p>
      <p>
        Founded by competitive exam researchers and technology professionals, our portal eliminates misinformation by serving as an independent, transparent, and direct bridge between recruiting authorities and millions of aspirants across the country.
      </p>

      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-red); font-size: 20px; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Our Mission &amp; Purpose</h2>
      <p>
        Every year, government departments release lakhs of vacancies across <b>UPSC, SSC, Railway Recruitment Boards (RRB), State PSCs, Police Recruitment Boards, Banking (IBPS, SBI), Defense Forces, and Teaching Commissions</b>. Aspirants often struggle with cluttered portals, dead links, or misleading fake circulars. Our mission is three-fold:
      </p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 18px;">
        <li><b>100% Primary Source Verification:</b> Every notification is cross-referenced with official gazettes and official commission websites before publishing.</li>
        <li><b>Fastest Real-Time Delivery:</b> Ultra-fast high-speed cloud edge servers ensure seamless access even during peak result announcements.</li>
        <li><b>Zero Candidate Fee Policy:</b> Govt Exam Zone is completely free for all aspirants. We never charge money or sell candidate data.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-red); font-size: 20px; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Editorial Standards &amp; Fact-Checking Policy</h2>
      <p>
        Our editorial desk follows a rigorous 4-step verification pipeline:
      </p>
      <ol style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 18px;">
        <li><b>Official Gazette Tracking:</b> Only notifications published by recognized statutory authorities are tracked.</li>
        <li><b>Cross-Verification of Dates &amp; Eligibility:</b> Age limits, reservation criteria, and qualification clauses are verified against the original PDF bulletin.</li>
        <li><b>Secure Direct Links:</b> Candidates are always provided official application URLs directly connecting to government server endpoints (.gov.in / .nic.in).</li>
        <li><b>Institutional Accountability:</b> Every notification is verified by our dedicated examination research desk responsible for accuracy and ongoing updates directly from official gazettes.</li>
      </ol>

      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px; margin-top: 24px;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #0f172a;">Official Communication &amp; Corrections</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 13.5px;">
          Noticed an error or wish to report a correction in any notification? Write directly to our research desk at:
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px;">
          <b>📧 Official Email:</b> <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:<%= (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.contact_email) ? settings.contact_email : 'contact.govtexamzone@gmail.com' %>" style="color: var(--primary-red); font-weight: bold;"><%= (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings.contact_email) ? settings.contact_email : 'contact.govtexamzone@gmail.com' %></a><!--/email_off--> | 
          <b>🌐 Portal:</b> <a href="/">Govt Exam Zone Official</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

